D = \tweak Stem.direction #DOWN \etc
U = \tweak Stem.direction #UP \etc


\header {
  texidoc = "Varies tie types.

    In measure 1, there is a cross-voice tie between beat 1 (in voice 1) and
    beat 2 (in voice 2). On beat 4, there is a enharmonic tie to the first note
    in measure 2.

    In measure 2, there are three “arpeggio ties” starting at the sixth,
    seventh, and eighth eighth note, respectively, tying to a chord on the first
    beat in measure 3.

    In measure 4, there is a laissez-vibrer tie on the eighth note."
}
